# SRG SRG-APP-000119-WSR-000069: The log information from the web server must be protected fr
# STIG ID: V-206369 (MEDIUM)
# Check: Web server file permissions

META
    esp_id `web-srg-srg-app-000119-wsr-000069-log-file-modify-perms-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `web-server`
    criticality `high`

    title `SRG SRG-APP-000119-WSR-000069: The log information from the web server must be protected from unauthorized modi`
    description `The log information from the web server must be protected from unauthorized modification.`
    author `example-security`
    tags `web-server,srg,disa-stig,permissions,internal`

    control_mapping `DISA-STIG:SRG-APP-000119-WSR-000069,NIST-800-53:AU-9`
    control_objective `AU-9`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `system-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `WebServer:localhost:web-hardening`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `30`
    recommendation `Review and remediate per DISA Web Server SRG guidance for SRG-APP-000119-WSR-000069.`

    component_id `comp-web-server`

    impl_AU_9 `This control is validated by probing the web server configuration or network endpoint against the DISA Web Server SRG baseline.`

META_END

DEF
    OBJECT target
        path `/var/log/nginx`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE perms_check
        exists boolean = true
        permissions string = `0640`
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN file_metadata
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF perms_check
            OBJECT_REF target
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
